<JournalSupport title="Terms and limitations" summary="Understand the scope of this independent reference toolkit.">
<div class="panel journal-support-card"><h2>Independent project</h2><p>Field &amp; Farm is not affiliated with the game developer. Game names identify the games and tasks the tools are intended to help with. Third-party artwork and reference code retain their respective rights and notices.</p><h2>Use and backups</h2><p>Tools are provided as reference utilities. Schematic geometry, experimental predictions and incomplete data are not guaranteed to reproduce the game. Keep your own save and layout backups. The tools do not write to the original game save.</p><h2>Privacy and corrections</h2><p>Review the <a href="/privacy/">privacy information</a> and <a href="/contact/">report errors or rights concerns</a>. This preview has no advertising or paid service.</p></div></JournalSupport>
